  <Properties>
    <blockList>
      <Value><![CDATA[{
  "contentData": [
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "41914047-aec3-497f-a8bd-fd6b8fabb894",
      "key": "f246af2d-1354-4450-a04e-1fad747b1944",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "text",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cp\u003ECookies are a normal part of every website. When we say cookies, this includes similar technologies like local storage. How much we do with them is your choice.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2\u003EAlways on\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThese are essential. This website wouldn\u0027t work without them.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ctable\u003E\n\u003Cthead\u003E\n\u003Ctr\u003E\n\u003Cth scope=\u0022col\u0022\u003EName\u003C/th\u003E\n\u003Cth scope=\u0022col\u0022\u003EPurpose\u003C/th\u003E\n\u003Cth scope=\u0022col\u0022\u003EHow long does it last?\u003C/th\u003E\n\u003C/tr\u003E\n\u003C/thead\u003E\n\u003Ctbody\u003E\n\u003Ctr\u003E\n\u003Cth scope=\u0022row\u0022\u003E.ASPXAUTH\u003C/th\u003E\n\u003Ctd\u003EIf you sign in, it keeps you signed in\u003C/td\u003E\n\u003Ctd\u003E30 minutes\u003C/td\u003E\n\u003C/tr\u003E\n\u003Ctr\u003E\n\u003Cth scope=\u0022row\u0022\u003EASP.NET_SessionId\u003C/th\u003E\n\u003Ctd\u003ELinks your visit together as you move from page to page\u003C/td\u003E\n\u003Ctd\u003EUntil you leave the site\u003C/td\u003E\n\u003C/tr\u003E\n\u003Ctr\u003E\n\u003Cth scope=\u0022row\u0022\u003E__RequestVerificationToken\u003C/th\u003E\n\u003Ctd\u003EUsed for a security check when you fill in any form\u003C/td\u003E\n\u003Ctd\u003EUntil you leave the site\u003C/td\u003E\n\u003C/tr\u003E\n\u003Ctr\u003E\n\u003Cth scope=\u0022row\u0022\u003EARRAffinity\u00A0\u003C/th\u003E\n\u003Ctd\u003EUsed by our hosting service to route you to our site\u003C/td\u003E\n\u003Ctd\u003EUntil you leave the site\u003C/td\u003E\n\u003C/tr\u003E\n\u003Ctr\u003E\n\u003Cth scope=\u0022row\u0022\u003Efeature_consent_*\u003Cbr /\u003Emaps_consent_*\u003Cbr /\u003Etracking_consent_*\u003C/th\u003E\n\u003Ctd\u003ERemember which cookies you allowed. This means we don\u0027t have to ask for your consent on every page.\u003C/td\u003E\n\u003Ctd\u003EUntil you change your mind\u003C/td\u003E\n\u003C/tr\u003E\n\u003C/tbody\u003E\n\u003C/table\u003E\n\u003Cdiv\u003E\n\u003Ch2\u003EOptional features, with no tracking\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWe don\u0027t use any cookies like this at the moment, but we may in future. They might save your preferred view of a page, for example. They will never be used for tracking.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "e8925975-0723-4e47-9837-14e874712218",
      "key": "28dfe528-20c6-4a88-ab27-8fcbcc507ad2",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "consentLevel",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "feature_consent"
        },
        {
          "alias": "label",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Allow optional features"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "41914047-aec3-497f-a8bd-fd6b8fabb894",
      "key": "891a41e8-3bfb-4ef8-b9fe-f88c1dd5b291",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "text",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Ch2\u003EMaps, with tracking\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIf you allow maps on this website, Google Maps may track your visit here for their own purposes including targeted advertising. What they do depends on your Google privacy settings.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWe can\u0027t list the cookies here because they are beyond our control and can change without our knowledge, but they are listed in \u003Ca href=\u0022https://policies.google.com/privacy?hl=en-GB\u0022 data-anchor=\u0022?hl=en-GB\u0022\u003EGoogle\u0027s privacy policy\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "e8925975-0723-4e47-9837-14e874712218",
      "key": "7251c740-641c-4ecb-bac6-1c8af221fc5a",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "consentLevel",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "maps_consent"
        },
        {
          "alias": "label",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Allow maps"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "41914047-aec3-497f-a8bd-fd6b8fabb894",
      "key": "7507e28a-b982-4e7b-a24e-e7a3ff254be9",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "text",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Ch2\u003ESocial media, with tracking\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOur links to services like Facebook, Instagram and Twitter don\u0027t use cookies, but things like showing Facebook and Instagram posts and Twitter feeds do.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIf you allow social media features on our website, these services may track your visit here for their own purposes including targeted advertising. What they do depends on your settings at these services.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWe can\u0027t list the cookies here because they are beyond our control and can change without our knowledge, but you can read:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https://en-gb.facebook.com/policy/cookies/\u0022\u003EFacebook\u0027s cookie policy\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https://help.twitter.com/en/rules-and-policies/twitter-cookies\u0022\u003E\u003C/a\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https://www.facebook.com/help/instagram/1896641480634370\u0022\u003EInstagram\u0027s cookie policy\u003C/a\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https://help.twitter.com/en/rules-and-policies/twitter-cookies\u0022\u003E\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https://help.twitter.com/en/rules-and-policies/twitter-cookies\u0022\u003ETwitter\u0027s cookie policy\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https://policies.google.com/privacy?hl=en-GB\u0022 data-anchor=\u0022?hl=en-GB\u0022\u003EGoogle\u0027s privacy policy (which applies to YouTube)\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
